{"id":"juin","lemma":"juin","pos":"noun","rank":2688,"glosses":["June"],"ipa":"/ʒɥɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/Fr-juin.ogg/Fr-juin.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"juins"},"formAudio":{"juins":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-juins.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle attend un bébé pour juin.","en":"She is expecting a baby in June.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"Ils doivent se marier en juin.","en":"They are to be married in June.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to marry, to marry off"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Il pleut beaucoup en juin.","en":"It rains a lot in June.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to rain","l":"pleuvoir"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Ma fille va se marier en juin.","en":"My daughter will get married in June.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"girl"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to marry, to marry off"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Je suis né le 4 juin 1974.","en":"I was born on June 4, 1974.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"to be born","l":"naître"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}